scn 1
# Bridge formation: a 48-body formation along a 64-cell, 6-cell-wide corridor.
# Geometry is crowdbench's `bridges` lane for 48 units (stride 3, 7 rows x 7 columns, lane z 26-60, map 384x128),
# but ONE formation: all 48 bodies get one click at (341, 46) (crowdbench gives each its own goal).
# Source: tools/crowdbench.cpp bridges; lanes2 variants lost 20-31% of arrivals here.
name bridgeform
ticks 7000
seed 7
map flat 384 128
wall 0 24 384 2
wall 0 61 384 2
wall 160 26 64 14
wall 160 46 64 15
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
group A 0 m 48 cells 50,36 50,39 50,42 50,45 50,48 50,51 50,54 47,36 47,39 47,42 47,45 47,48 47,51 47,54 44,36 44,39 44,42 44,45 44,48 44,51 44,54 41,36 41,39 41,42 41,45 41,48 41,51 41,54 38,36 38,39 38,42 38,45 38,48 38,51 38,54 35,36 35,39 35,42 35,45 35,48 35,51 35,54 32,36 32,39 32,42 32,45 32,48 32,51
gate bridge 192 26 192 60
line past 230 0 230 128
at 1 move A 341 46
